Launch yourself toward a target. If the target is reached you get a free attack doing [112%, 138%, 158%, 175%, 190% (TL1-5)] weapon damage.

If the attack hits you release a massive burst of fire in radius [1, 3, 3, 4, 4 (TL1-5)], knocking away all enemies except your target and dealing [114, 154, 185, 211, 234 (TL1-5; SP 100)] damage.

You must charge from at least 2 tiles away.
